000100*================================================================
000200* RDPLB  PUBLIC LIABILITY RISK DETAIL
000300*        THE 60-BYTE POL-RISK-DETAIL OF POLREC FOR LINE PLB.
000400*        USED BY RATPLB01.
000500*        policy-admin FILLS THE SAME 60 BYTES IN PRMCOMM
000600*        REQ-RISK-DETAIL WHEN IT CALLS PRMCALC0.
000700*
000800*  TURNOVER-K      ANNUAL TURNOVER, THOUSANDS
000900*  TRADE-RISK      TRADE RISK BAND 1-5
001000*  EMPLOYEES       HEADCOUNT
001100*  CLAIMS-5Y       LIABILITY CLAIMS IN 5 YEARS
001200*  WORK-AT-HEIGHT  Y = WORK ABOVE 3 METRES
001300*================================================================
001400 01  WS-PLB-DETAIL.
001500     05  WS-TURNOVER-K            PIC 9(07).
001600     05  WS-TRADE-RISK            PIC 9(01).
001700     05  WS-EMPLOYEES             PIC 9(04).
001800     05  WS-CLAIMS-5Y             PIC 9(02).
001900     05  WS-WORK-AT-HEIGHT        PIC X(01).
002000     05  FILLER                  PIC X(45).
